{
  "id": "049a7315-4723-4769-ac40-bee04cc671da",
  "name": "Reply to missed calls by SMS with Twilio and book appointments from voice call summaries",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "f23ff426-c666-49e5-b63d-dc924ca874d1",
      "name": "Template Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -720,
        220
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 4,
        "width": 460,
        "height": 780,
        "content": "### How it works\nMissed calls are lost revenue \u2014 most callers who reach voicemail never call back. This workflow fixes that in two layers.\nLayer 1, missed-call text-back: Twilio posts call-status webhooks here. When an inbound call is missed, the workflow instantly texts the caller back, logs the call to Google Sheets, and alerts the business owner. The whole loop runs in under a minute.\nLayer 2, voice booking: if you run a voice AI receptionist (Vapi, Retell), it POSTs its end-of-call summary here. The workflow extracts the booking details with AI, builds the event times, creates a Google Calendar event, texts the caller a confirmation, logs everything to Sheets, and notifies the owner. Appointments get booked while you sleep.\n\n### Setup\n1. Connect your own credentials: Twilio, Google Sheets, Google Calendar, OpenAI. None are included.\n2. Fill the two CONFIG nodes: business name, phone numbers, log sheet ID, calendar ID, booking link.\n3. In your Twilio number's Voice configuration, set \"A call comes in\" to the production URL of the Twilio Call Webhook node.\n4. In Vapi or Retell, point the end-of-call report webhook at the production URL of the Voice Summary Webhook node.\n5. Create MissedCalls and VoiceCalls tabs in your log sheet (MissedCalls: timestamp, caller, call_status / VoiceCalls: timestamp, caller_name, caller_phone, service, booked, notes). Test with a real call before relying on it."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "3f5a1426-acc6-4369-8ee0-63f133891ed2",
      "name": "Section - Missed-call text-back",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -60,
        330
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 1620,
        "height": 260,
        "content": "## Layer 1 \u2014 Missed-call text-back\nTwilio reports every inbound call here. If the call was missed, the workflow texts the caller back instantly, logs it to the MissedCalls sheet, and alerts the owner. Set your Twilio number in CONFIG - Phone first."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "4a9f4542-c51b-44a6-9b1c-e09a03604933",
      "name": "Section - Voice booking",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -60,
        850
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 2400,
        "height": 380,
        "content": "## Layer 2 \u2014 Voice AI booking\nYour voice AI posts call summaries to the webhook. n8n extracts the booking details, builds event times, creates the calendar event, confirms by SMS, and logs everything. No booking? The run stops after logging."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
